                    </h2>
                    <div class="qr-row reveal d3">
                        <div class="load-unit">
                            <div aria-label="Đang tải" role="img" class="wheel-and-hamster">
                                <div class="wheel"></div>
                                <div class="hamster">
                                    <div class="hamster__body">
                                        <div class="hamster__head">
                                            <div class="hamster__ear"></div>
                                            <div class="hamster__eye"></div>
                                            <div class="hamster__nose"></div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="hamster__limb hamster__limb--fr"></div>
                                        <div class="hamster__limb hamster__limb--fl"></div>
                                        <div class="hamster__limb hamster__limb--br"></div>
                                        <div class="hamster__limb hamster__limb--bl"></div>
                                        <div class="hamster__tail"></div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="spoke"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="qr-message">Cảm ơn mọi người đã theo dõi — <span class="shrink">nếu có câu hỏi nào thì mình cứ <em2>theo dõi</em2> ạ</span>, em cảm ơn.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flip-stage reveal d3" id="flipStage">
                        <div class="flip-stage-inner" id="flipStageInner">
                            <div class="flip-face flip-front">
                                <div class="flip-clock">
                                    <div class="clock-digit" id="dTens" data-value="3">
                                        <div class="half static-top"><span>3</span></div>
                                        <div class="half static-bottom"><span>3</span></div>
                                        <div class="flap-top"><span>3</span></div>
                                        <div class="flap-bottom"><span>3</span></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="clock-digit" id="dOnes" data-value="5">
                                        <div class="half static-top"><span>5</span></div>
                                        <div class="half static-bottom"><span>5</span></div>
                                        <div class="flap-top"><span>5</span></div>
                                        <div class="flap-bottom"><span>5</span></div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="clock-unit-label">Em yêu Kienlong</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flip-face flip-back">
                                <img class="qr-img" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="QR điểm danh" />
                                <div class="qr-caption">forms.office.com · điểm danh</div>
